   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark cinematic: median ~56, deep blacks (p1 ~4), blue-violet shadows (28,26,31 / hue 264), cool-neutral highlights (220,220,211), blue 33% + aqua 19% of colour mass, saturation 0.40, warm skin (hue 28) against cool surroundings. Best for: Low-key cinematic portraits, blue-hour and moody interiors, power portraits of grooms and fathers, film-poster couple frames. Dark and cool.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
